      "type": "event",
      "date": "2025-11-28T00:00:00.000Z",
      "title": "Shree Rajasthan Syntex Limited announced that it has received INR 107.65625 million in funding from Peppy Enterprises, Manglam Yarn Agencies, Clk Shares And Securities Pvt Ltd, Shree Shyam Distributors And Marketing Private Limited and other individual investors.",
      "body": "On November 28, 2025, Shree Rajasthan Syntex Limited closed the transaction. The company issued 81,25,000 shares at an issue price of INR 13.25 for gross proceeds of INR 107,656,250. The transaction included participation from  Shree Shyam Distributors And Marketing Private Limited for 5,50,000 shares, Amit Kumar Gupta for 7,50,000 shares, CLK Shares and Securities Private Limited for 500,000 shares, Khurshed Rustom Dordi for 265,000 shares, Manglam Yarn Agencies for 925,000 shares, Peppy Enterprise for 2,000,000 shares, Rajesh Narain 400,000 shares, Yash Kela for 1,000,000 shares, Shatul Kamal Gupta for 660,000 shares, Anish Kishore modi for 1,075,000 shares. The transaction is approved by board of directors of the company.",
